<title>SINGAPORE: Freight Links 1st half profit up 67.2-pct.</title>
<headline>Freight Links 1st half profit up 67.2-pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 31 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				3.01 vs 2.13</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			 nil vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     2.45 vs 2.54</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)   2.40 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				 88.19 vs 39.93</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.26 vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    1.65 vs 0.47</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		2.34 vs 1.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  4.81 vs 2.88</p>
<p>    Tax					 1.57 vs 0.74</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (loss) 0.23 vs 0.01 (loss)</p>
<p>    Exceptionals		   (gain) 1.45 vs nil</p>
<p>Note - Freight Links Express Holdings Ltd said good business conditions and strong regional traffic helped life turnover 121 percent on year with pre-tax profits increased 67.2 percent by this and contributions from acquisitions of Flying Freight Agency (S) Pte Ltd and Piow Hong (Pte) Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
